docs/plans/2026-05-16-cognitive-workspace-fork-build/tasks/T13.md:36:3. Define the primary entry point: `pub fn EventWriter::append(&self, envelope: PartialEnvelope) -> Result<EventId, EventWriteError>`. `PartialEnvelope` contains the caller-supplied fields (kind, references, payload, summary, optional task_id, session_id, actor); the writer fills in `event_id`, `timestamp` (UTC monotonic via `chrono::Utc::now()` plus a per-session monotonic tiebreaker), `payload_hash`, and `payload_location`.
